In the `main` function, the program first creates a tournament and then asks for player names. Each player is added to the tournament. The program then simulates matches between pairs of players until only one player is left. The remaining player's Elo rating is printed.

Note that this program assumes that the players have the same starting Elo rating (1200) and that the tournament uses the same winning margin (1.4) for all matches. The time control and other tournament settings are also not implemented.

